and(4) build(5) wealth(6) on(7) purpose(8) today.(9)' Count is 9. Passes budget."},"criterion_6_segment_s01":{"satisfied":false,"field":"visual_intent","quote":"A physical paper agreement card lies flat on a neutral surface. A blank calendar sheet rests beside it, showing no specific dates or moving elements.","reason":"Fails unsupported_visual_intent: Describes 'blank' but does not explicitly state the presence of the required reminder mark before cutoff mark as per registered target."},"criterion_6_segment_s02":{"satisfied":false,"field":"visual_intent","quote":"The same physical paper agreement remains visible with its text legible but unmarked. The adjacent blank calendar stays empty without any drawn reminders or cutoff lines added to the raster.","reason":"Fails unsupported_visual_intent: Explicitly states 'without any drawn reminders', contradicting target requirement for a reminder mark."},"criterion_6_segment_s03":{"satisfied":true,"field":"visual_intent","quote":"A static illustration of a standard wall calendar shows two distinct marks: one small dot representing a reminder and another separate mark indicating the cancellation deadline, both fixed on the page surface.","reason":"Correctly describes physical objects with required reminder and cutoff marks."},"criterion_6_segment_s04":{"satisfied":true,"field":"visual_intent","quote":"A static illustration of the 'Wealth Blueprint' logo centered clearly in a neutral background with no moving elements or embedded text other than what the renderer adds as captions.","reason":"Correctly describes physical object (logo) without UI switches."}},"issues":[{"code":"brief_fidelity","segment_ids":["s02"],"detail":"Instructs recording rather than explaining checking terms/price/cutoff; uses prop-focused language instead of viewer action explanation.","evidence":{"segment_id":"s02","field":"text","quote":"Open your agreement now. Read the stated renewal price and record the specific cancellation cutoff date listed there clearly for yourself to see later."}},{"code":"brief_fidelity","segment_ids":["s01","s02"],"detail":"On-screen headlines are bare object lists ('Renewal Status', 'Price & Cutoff') rather than imperatives explaining actions performed in scene.","evidence":{"segment_id":"s01","field":"on_screen","quote":"Check Renewal Status"},"fields":["text"]},{"code":"brief_fidelity","segment_ids":["s02"],"detail":"On-screen headline is a bare object list ('Price & Cutoff') rather than an imperative action explaining the check performed.","evidence":{"segment_id":"s02","field":"on_screen","quote":"Check Renewal Price & Cutoff"},"fields":["text"]}]}
